   sheet's glyph in the page's ink; each screen's tile unfolds from its bar
   in the glyph when a change arrives. */
.rf-strip { position: relative; flex: none; height: 44px; margin: 12px 12px 0; }
/* Each tile sits on a grey ground, so it reads as something to press; where
   you are is the lit tint and ink. */
.rf-strip-all, .rf-tile { position: absolute; padding: 0; border: 0; background: var(--rf-fill); color: var(--rf-muted); cursor: pointer; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
.rf-strip-all[aria-current], .rf-tile[aria-current] { background: var(--lit-tint); color: var(--lit-ink); }
