   pair shows your choice in place, and the round ⋯ grows into Next change. */
.rf-vote { flex: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.rf-why { flex: none; height: 44px; margin-bottom: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: opacity .25s, transform .3s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1); }
.rf-why-off { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); pointer-events: none; }
